# GRCh38 ELS source pools by chromosome

This directory contains the chromosome-specific positive ELS and generated
negative source pools used by `src/make_GRCh38_master_training.py`.

BED and FASTA records correspond by position within each chromosome/class pair.
The negative pools are reused; the master and learning-curve stages do not
generate new negatives.

| chromosome | source_positive_records | missing_negative_records | selected_benchmark_records_per_class |
|:-----------|------------------------:|-------------------------:|-------------------------------------:|
| chr1       |                 153,196 |                       75 |                               18,069 |
| chr2       |                 144,254 |                       65 |                               17,014 |
| chr3       |                 113,596 |                       22 |                               13,398 |
| chr4       |                  86,232 |                       46 |                               10,171 |
| chr5       |                  97,469 |                       20 |                               11,496 |
| chr6       |                 101,231 |                       34 |                               11,940 |
| chr7       |                  90,955 |                       63 |                               10,728 |
| chr8       |                  83,028 |                       28 |                                9,793 |
| chr9       |                  74,200 |                       35 |                                8,751 |
| chr10      |                  85,396 |                       39 |                               10,072 |
| chr11      |                  85,530 |                       32 |                               10,088 |
| chr12      |                  83,790 |                       27 |                                9,883 |
| chr13      |                  47,845 |                       22 |                                5,643 |
