| chrX       |                  41,518 |                       20 |                                4,897 |
| chrY       |                   1,837 |                        0 |                                    0 |

The selected counts use Hamilton largest-remainder allocation with target
202,493 records per class and seed 42. chrY is excluded. The selected chr1 quota
is routed to fixed validation, chr2 to fixed testing, and all other selected
chromosomes to fixed learning-curve training.
